// Campaign-walk probe (2026-10-22): alley's level pools point at a sub-folder only this mod has. .merge merges arrays
// element-wise by index (docs/data-mods.md), so each one-item pool's single entry "easy"/"rare" becomes "walkprobe":
// MapLevelPool_build 0x394450 then lists levels/alley/walkprobe/*.lvl (FileManager_ListDir walks the -modpaths) and
// the first map's battle nodes can only draw levels/alley/walkprobe/wp_alley.lvl. Boss/miniboss pools stay vanilla.
levels {
    easy [walkprobe]
    hard [walkprobe]
    rare [walkprobe]
}
